r{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a>:</b> <b>Leather</b> armor is made of the hide of animals. It provides decent protection without excessively restricting the user's movements.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">14\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF; width: 150px;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; width: 450px;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0006420000</span>6,420<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Ascension_Chamber\" title=\"Ascension Chamber\">Ascension Chamber</a></b>, Raid Warded chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Ghostly\" title=\"Ghostly\"> Ghostly</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Ghostly\" title=\"Ghostly\"> Ghostly</a>:</b> Equipping this item causes you to become partially incorporeal. Your melee attacks do not roll a miss chance for Incorporeal targets. Enemy attacks have a 10% chance to miss you due to <a href=\"/page/Incorporeal\" title=\"Incorporeal\">incorporeality</a>. You receive a +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to your <a href=\"/page/Hide\" title=\"Hide\">Hide</a> and <a href=\"/page/Move_Silently\" title=\"Move Silently\">Move Silently</a> skills.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Nullification\" title=\"Nullification\">Nullification +72</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Nullification\" title=\"Nullification\">Nullification +72</a>:</b> Passive: +72 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Negative (Necrotic) and Poison <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Stealth_Strike\" title=\"Stealth Strike\">Stealth Strike</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Stealth_Strike\" title=\"Stealth Strike\">Stealth Strike</a>:</b> Reduces the threat generated by ranged attacks and spells by 15%.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sneak_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack Bonus\">  Sneak Attack Bonus +4</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sneak_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack Bonus\">  Sneak Attack Bonus +4</a></b>&#160;: Provides a +4 Enhancement modifier to your attack bonus and a +6 Enhancement bonus to damage for any attack that would qualify as a Sneak Attack, even if the wielder is not a Rogue.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_Item_(Black_Abbot)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable Item (Black Abbot)\">Upgradeable Item (Black Abbot)</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_Item_(Black_Abbot)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable Item (Black Abbot)\">Upgradeable Item (Black Abbot)</a>: This item could be upgraded if you found a <a href=\"/page/Item:Seal_of_the_Black_Abbot\" title=\"Item:Seal of the Black Abbot\">Seal of the Black Abbot</a> to combine it with. Bring this item to the <a href=\"/page/Fountain_of_Necrotic_Might\" title=\"Fountain of Necrotic Might\">Fountain of Necrotic Might</a> outside the <a href=\"/page/Black_Mausoleum\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Black Mausoleum\">Black Mausoleum</a> and combine it with a Seal of the Black Abbot to upgrade the item to a more powerful form.</span></span>\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sneak_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack Bonus\">  Sneak Attack Bonus +4</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sneak_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack Bonus\">  Sneak Attack Bonus +4</a></b>&#160;: Provides a +4 Enhancement modifier to your attack bonus and a +6 Enhancement bonus to damage for any attack that would qualify as a Sneak Attack, even if the wielder is not a Rogue.</span></span>  &#8594; <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sneak_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack Bonus\">  Sneak Attack Bonus +5</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sneak_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack Bonus\">  Sneak Attack Bonus +5</a></b>&#160;: Provides a +5 Enhancement modifier to your attack bonus and a +8 Enhancement bonus to damage for any attack that would qualify as a Sneak Attack, even if the wielder is not a Rogue.</span></span></li>\n<li>Adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Void Lore V</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Void Lore V</a>:</b> Passive: Your Negative Energy and Poison spells gain a 15% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Cloak Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Cloak Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Wretched_Twilight.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Wretched_Twilight.png/420px-Wretched_Twilight.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"489\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Wretched_Twilight.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Fountain_of_Necrotic_Might\" title=\"Fountain of Necrotic Might\">Fountain of Necrotic Might</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>Nerezza's shadow is made of a material completely foreign to you; it flows with your body yet feels like you are wearing nothing.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817232801\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.094 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.150 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4373/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38105/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12777/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 2/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n116.96%  150.574     59 Template:IO\n100.00%  128.738      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  128.738      1 -total\n 97.60%  125.649      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 38.11%   49.056      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 37.43%   48.190      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 36.77%   47.331      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 36.03%   46.387      2 Template:InCategory\n 23.29%   29.977     11 Template:Popup\n 16.23%   20.888      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:8735-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817232801 and revision id 677098. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
